# The Last Alibi

A story-driven, console-based mystery game built in **C++17**.

Players investigate a mystery through terminal-based scenes, character
dialogue, branching choices, evidence collection, and a collection of
logic, decoding, and strategy minigames. The project is designed to
support solo play first, local co-op next, and potentially online
multiplayer later.

> **Project status:** Early planning / foundation stage. Features and
> interfaces described below are targets, not claims that they are
> already implemented.

